@startuml
|Student/Alumni|
start
:Select Draft or Correction Required record;
|Web UI / API|
:Send request;
|Application Service|
:Check owner and transition;
if (Eligible to submit?) then (yes)
  |Repository / Database|
  :Begin transaction;
  :Set Submitted; audit; show queue status;
  :Commit;
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show success;
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show state or permission error;
endif
stop
@enduml
